flowchart LR
    P[Producer thread] --> S[Thread-local ostream]
    S --> B[QueueStreamBuf<br/>pending text]
    B -->|newline or flush| F{LogFilter<br/>allows?}
    F -->|enabled| Q[LogState<br/>BlockingMpmcQueue]
    F -->|disabled| D[Discard record]
    Q --> W[Single writer thread]
    W --> E[stderr]
    L[LoggingProvider] --> ST[shared LogState]
    ST --> B
    ST --> Q
    ST --> W
